  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.3.3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.3.2...v13.3.3) (2026-10-13)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **operator:** retry scope resync on transient re-list failures ([#1272](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1272)) ([70e548e](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/70e548e2cb89c241276792232f8f45d17cd4bfa3)), closes [#1271](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1271)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update helm/kind-action action to v1.15.1 ([#1270](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1270)) ([530e379](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/530e379ac119eca43dd65d04ff5e41c2819678e7))\n* **core:** update aspire monorepo ([#1274](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1274)) ([6c81937](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/6c8193725fcf268a6ed41caa273513b8497ea70f))\n* **core:** update dependency messagepack to 3.1.12 ([#1276](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1276)) ([ca1af9b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/ca1af9b450358db124cb4fb708b4b168aee41ac0))\n* **test:** remove unused source generator testing package ([#1273](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1273)) ([debdb04](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/debdb047cc198d72ce2d392120ee9dbf77b4d493))\n* **test:** update xunit-dotnet monorepo ([#1275](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1275)) ([b160118](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/b160118e1ad6df9faf25d6f026f000001c0b677b))\n'",
